# GludioWizardStand's clan-attacked hook on Aden's standing wizard (35249), before it has
# seen anyone: a hit on a clan mate, the knight (35235), calls it, and on a draw of 10 it
# stays idle; on the next hit's draw of 0 (under 10) it wants to cast its DD magic, the
# shipped Aden Flame (4114), on the character from where it stands, weight 1000000.
character Hunter 20
random 10 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioWizardStand
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioHold
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioKnight
npc knight 35235 SiegeGuard 100 0 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300
npc wizard 35249 SiegeGuard 100 150 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300 skill DD_MAGIC 4114 1

hit knight 22
  desires wizard -

hit knight 22
  desires wizard cast(player,4114)=1000000
